00:11:19.907 --> 00:11:21.775
Like,
I'm not expecting them to end the movie

00:11:21.775 --> 00:11:24.478
with Zero Power,
but there might be a big twist.

00:11:24.478 --> 00:11:27.081
Usually in a movie like this,
they pull a Thor Ragnarok

00:11:27.081 --> 00:11:29.483
where they recontextualize the way
their powers work,

00:11:29.483 --> 00:11:32.086
or they find a different source
for their powers.

00:11:32.086 --> 00:11:34.221
That's also one of the big things
about the Shazam characters.

00:11:34.221 --> 00:11:35.756
It's the same for Black Adam too.

00:11:35.756 --> 00:11:38.092
They can get the same power,
but from different gods,

00:11:38.092 --> 00:11:39.159
like they can make bargains

00:11:39.159 --> 00:11:42.563
or contracts with different gods,
so they have the same abilities.

00:11:42.563 --> 00:11:45.466
The other thing they might wind up doing,
because it seems like Hospira,

00:11:45.466 --> 00:11:47.668
Rachel Ziegler's character,
goes against her sisters,

00:11:47.668 --> 00:11:50.504
is that by the end of the movie
they'll come to an agreement with them

00:11:50.504 --> 00:11:52.539
and they'll start acting
more like the patron gods

00:11:52.539 --> 00:11:55.576
granting their powers
to the Shazam family.

00:11:55.576 --> 00:11:57.878
Whereas at the beginning of the movie,
they're trying to take everything back.

00:11:57.878 --> 00:11:59.413
But in the original comics,

00:11:59.413 --> 00:12:03.851
Shazam didn't take all the power
from like Zuse and the other Greek gods.

00:12:03.851 --> 00:12:06.386
They were just granted access
to that power

00:12:06.386 --> 00:12:08.822
by the gods
who were still alive at the time.

00:12:08.822 --> 00:12:11.992
The big change in the DC Universe, though,
is that all those Greek gods

00:12:11.992 --> 00:12:15.229
are supposed to have died a long time ago,
according to Wonder Woman.

00:12:15.229 --> 00:12:16.797
But because we have the big James Gunn

00:12:16.797 --> 00:12:20.868
DC Phase one reboot, obviously
a lot of that doesn't matter anymore.

